From 9a1c7d3e5b2f4a6c8d0e1f3a5b7c9d0e2f4a6b8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Linyaps Runtime Maintainers <dev@deepin.org>
Date: Tue, 4 Nov 2026 17:10:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build-depends: match the single-flavour, docs-disabled build

The committed debian/control is generated for the full multi-flavour build:
it wants libsoup2.4-dev (soup2 flavour, disabled by
0002-build-only-webkit2gtk-4.1-soup3-flavour) and the Build-Depends-Indep of
gi-docgen + jdupes (only used to merge API docs, and ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION is
off).

dpkg-buildpackage runs dpkg-checkbuilddeps before debian/rules regenerates
control, so with a clean container these three unused packages abort the build:

  dpkg-checkbuilddeps: error: Unmet build dependencies: libsoup2.4-dev gi-docgen jdupes

Drop them from both debian/control and debian/control.in so the declared
Build-Depends reflects what we actually build. libgtk-4-dev goes away with
libsoup2.4-dev for the same reason (it belongs to the gtk4 flavour).
---
 debian/control    | 3 +--
 debian/control.in | 1 -
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@
                libmanette-0.2-dev [!hurd-any],
                libxslt1-dev,
                libxml2-dev,
-               libsoup2.4-dev,libsoup-3.0-dev,libgtk-3-dev,libgtk-4-dev,
+               libsoup-3.0-dev,libgtk-3-dev,
                libsqlite3-dev,
                libsystemd-dev [!hurd-any],
                libgudev-1.0-dev [!hurd-any],
@@ -53,7 +53,6 @@
                libegl-dev,
                libgl-dev,
                libgles-dev
-Build-Depends-Indep: gi-docgen, jdupes
 Standards-Version: 4.7.2
 Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/webkit-team/webkit
 Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/webkit-team/webkit.git
diff --git a/debian/control.in b/debian/control.in
--- a/debian/control.in
+++ b/debian/control.in
@@ -52,7 +52,6 @@
                libegl-dev,
                libgl-dev,
                libgles-dev
-Build-Depends-Indep: gi-docgen, jdupes
 Standards-Version: 4.7.2
 Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/webkit-team/webkit
 Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/webkit-team/webkit.git
